N Q65.AK653.J3.KQ5      | 1NT P          | 2D     | 15 HCP + 1 length = 16 with five hearts: transfer first, then 4NT

# A strong responder never passes 1NT. Too strong for 3NT with a long
# minor, he bids it; otherwise 3NT is the fallback.
card    Basic-Bridge
N 54.AQ.KQ6.AQ8654      | 1NT P          | 3C     | 17 with six clubs: too strong for 3NT
N Q.K9.AQJ843.KQ87      | 1NT P          | 3D     | 17 with six diamonds
N QT7.8.KQ72.AKQT6      | 1NT P          | 3C  | 16 with 5-4 in the minors: slam try in clubs (2026-09-27)
N KQ2.Q8.KQ72.A874      | 1NT P          | 4NT    | 16 balanced: quantitative
N 54.A2.KQ6.Q98654      | 1NT P          | 3NT    | 11 with six clubs: game values, play 3NT

